cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite GLIM.
title: glim_localization
type: software
authors:
  - alias: atinfinity
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/atinfinity/glim_localization
abstract: >-
  LiDAR-IMU localization on a prebuilt 3D map, built on top of GLIM and gtsam_points.
  It replaces GLIM's odometry module with a localization module that adds scan-to-map
  VGICP factors to GLIM's tightly coupled LiDAR-IMU fixed-lag smoother, with offline
  replay tools and ROS 2 integration.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "GLIM: 3D Range-Inertial Localization and Mapping with GPU-Accelerated Scan Matching Factors"
    authors:
      - family-names: Koide
        given-names: Kenji
      - family-names: Yokozuka
        given-names: Masashi
      - family-names: Oishi
        given-names: Shuji
      - family-names: Banno
        given-names: Atsuhiko
    journal: Robotics and Autonomous Systems
    volume: 179
    year: 2024
    doi: 10.1016/j.robot.2024.104750
